    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present No. 6 Castlegate Crescent to the market, a beautifully appointed upper-floor duplex residence enjoying stunning views over the surrounding landscape and complemented by an impressive private south-facing terrace. Ideally positioned within the highly regarded Castlethorn development, this exceptional home is located just 2km from Lucan Village and within easy walking distance of the SuperValu Shopping Centre, offering an unrivalled combination of convenience and lifestyle.\nBoasting an impressive B BER rating, this energy-efficient property offers reduced running costs and is likely to appeal to purchasers seeking to avail of competitive Green Mortgage rates, while enjoying the benefits of a modern, well-designed home.\nThe accommodation is both spacious and thoughtfully laid out. Upon entering, a welcoming entrance hall leads to three generously proportioned bedrooms, all of which benefit from fitted wardrobes. The main bedroom enjoys the added advantage of an en-suite bathroom, while a well-appointed family bathroom completes the accommodation at this level.\nUpstairs, the heart of the home is a bright and expansive open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, designed to maximise natural light and create a wonderful space for both everyday family living and entertaining. This impressive room opens directly onto a large, south-facing terrace that spans the full width of the property, providing the perfect setting for outdoor dining, relaxation, and enjoying the sunny aspect throughout the day.\nExternally, the property further benefits from off-street parking and beautifully maintained communal surroundings.\nThe location of No. 6 Castlegate Crescent is truly exceptional. Situated directly opposite the historic Finnstown Castle, Castlegate has earned a reputation as one of Lucan's most sought-after residential developments, renowned for its quality homes, mature surroundings, and strong sense of community. Residents enjoy the perfect balance of peaceful suburban living and excellent connectivity, with a wide range of amenities within easy reach.\nLucan Village, with its charming blend of heritage and modern convenience, is just minutes away and offers an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, supermarkets, and local services. The recently opened Lidl is within walking distance, while Lucan Shopping Centre, Liffey Valley Shopping Centre, and The Crossings provide an extensive array of retail, dining, and leisure facilities to suit every need.\nFamilies are particularly well served by the area, with an excellent choice of highly regarded primary and secondary schools nearby, as well as numerous parks, sporting facilities, playgrounds, and recreational amenities. The development has proven exceptionally popular with owner-occupiers seeking quality homes within a well-established and family-friendly community.\nFor commuters, the location offers outstanding accessibility. Adamstown Train Station is within walking distance and provides regular services to Park West, Heuston Station, Connolly Station, Pearse Street, and Grand Canal Dock, ensuring swift and convenient access to Dublin City Centre. In addition, the nearby N4 and M50 road networks provide seamless connectivity to Dublin Airport, surrounding counties, and the wider Dublin region.\nCombining contemporary design, excellent energy efficiency, spacious accommodation, exceptional outdoor space, and a prime location, No. 6 Castlegate Crescent presents a superb opportunity to acquire a stylish family home in one of Lucan's most desirable modern developments.\nViewing is highly recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nSpacious and welcoming entrance hall featuring laminate flooring and providing access to all bedrooms and the main family bathroom.\n\nOpen Plan Living / Kitchen / Dining Room - \nA large and impressive triple-aspect open-plan living, kitchen, and dining area flooded with natural light. The contemporary kitchen boasts an abundance of base and eye-level storage units, complemented by extensive countertop workspace and a range of integrated and freestanding appliances. A patio door opens directly onto a private, sunny south-facing terrace, creating the perfect space for outdoor dining and relaxation.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.64m x 3.46m\nGenerously proportioned double bedroom featuring carpet flooring, a built-in wardrobe, and the added benefit of a private en-suite bathroom.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.49m x 0.92m\nWell-appointed en-suite comprising tiled flooring, WC, WHB, and a walk-in shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.44m x 2.88m\nSpacious double bedroom featuring carpet flooring and a built-in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.59m x 2.10m\nWell-proportioned single bedroom with carpet flooring and a built-in wardrobe, ideal as a child's bedroom, home office, or guest room.\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.16m x 1.75m\nBright and spacious family bathroom featuring tiled flooring, WC, WHB, and a bathtub with overhead shower, offering both practicality and comfort for modern family living.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Impressive top floor 3 bed duplex </li><li>G.F.C.H</li><li>Spacious south-facing terrace </li><li>Open plan concept </li><li>Spacious floor plan</li><li>Walking distance to Lucan Village and Super Value Shopping Centre. </li><li>Serviced by a number of public transports. To include Train station within walking distance, and bus stops at your doorstep.</ul>"
      },
